#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Controls:\n"
"{up}: up, {left}: left\n"
"{down}: down, {right}: right\n"
"{menu}: menu\n"
"\n"
"In tall grass (;), wild Poketes may attack you.\n"
"Weaken them to catch them, or defeat them to gain XP.\n"
"Approach NPCs to talk to them.\n"
"More information:\n"
"https://github.com/deepbreathnoob/pokete_ai/blob/master/docs/HowToPlay.md"
msgstr ""
"Sterowanie:\n"
"{up}: góra, {left}: lewo\n"
"{down}: dół, {right}: prawo\n"
"{menu}: menu\n"
"\n"
"W wysokiej trawie (;) mogą zaatakować dzikie Pokete.\n"
"Osłab je, aby je złapać, lub pokonaj, aby zdobyć XP.\n"
"Podejdź do postaci, aby rozpocząć rozmowę.\n"
"Więcej informacji:\n"
"https://github.com/deepbreathnoob/pokete_ai/blob/master/docs/HowToPlay.md"

